ss=\"jolene-follow-btn\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/thejolenecoffee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n      <rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"5\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"0.9\" fill=\"var(--jolene-ink)\" stroke=\"none\"/>\n    </svg>\n    <span class=\"jolene-follow-btn-text\">Follow @thejolenecoffee</span>\n  </a>\n</div>",
